  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative and Innovative economy development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Creative and Innovative Economy Development Project aims to diversify Turkmenistans economy by fostering a culture of innovation and entrepreneurship. The project will achieve this through two key activities: first, conducting a comprehensive legislative analysis and preparing recommendations to support a creative and innovative economy; second, organizing a major forum to promote creative, innovative and circular economy practices among potential stakeholders, including government representatives, international development agencies, businesses the UK and re-gional experts.</narrative>
  </description>
